libmspub is a library and a set of tools for reading and converting
MSPublisher files.

libmspub requires boost, icu, librevenge and zlib to build.

Building with meson:

    meson setup builddir
    ninja -C builddir
    ninja -C builddir install

Build options (meson configure builddir):
  -Dtools=true|false     build conversion tools (default: true)
  -Ddocs=true|false      build documentation with doxygen (default: true)
  -Dfuzzers=true|false   build fuzzer(s) (default: false)

The library is available under MPL 2.0 license.
